From: Sebberich <sebberich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 09:48:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 31/33] Mobile: Shopping list backup, pull to refresh, manual
 emoji and icon statistics

- Export/import all lists as a JSON file, optionally password-encrypted
  (PBKDF2-SHA256 + AES-256-GCM via shim.crypto); import merges per field,
  device identity only on explicit confirmation.
- Pull to refresh on the list and the overview (relays and nearby peers,
  15 s limit, status line).
- Set an item's emoji by hand, optionally "always use for <name>" shared
  per list via the list settings (merged per key).
- Local, opt-in statistics of items without a catalog icon, CSV export.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015mATJ5zDWtHUm4X7vhb9u2

